{"version":1,"content":"<p>如外界所料，阿里要分拆平頭哥赴港上市了。11月10日晚，阿里發佈公告稱，擬將旗下晶片公司平頭哥在港交所主板獨立上市。平頭哥早在今年9月11日，就已保密遞交上市申請。據媒體報道，平頭哥計劃明年赴港上市，可能募集20億至30億美元。不過，具體發行規模和上市時間，阿里尚未披露。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585914.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.236944+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:39:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"fac5e8fead56f4b3d27072696f93f2d4e9dfa18e0ea084145623779cf1ec6a86","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}